yyjson 0.13.0, the JSON library behind the QP JSON output
(https://github.com/ibireme/yyjson, MIT, copyright YaoYuan/ibireme, see
LICENSE). Pinned at release 0.13.0 and vendored as the flat amalgamation
(single .c/.h) instead of a submodule: it is a one-shot external library,
compiled exactly once by the QP build system (rule build_yyjson / the
$(YYJSON_LIB) recipe) into $QP_ROOT/lib/libyyjson.a, so no fetch is needed
at build time. The shim src/json/qp_json_shim.c includes yyjson.h through
src/json/CFLAGS (-I$QP_ROOT/external/yyjson).
